37268>>>>>    //
37268>>>>>    // This procedure is called when validating a session and after logging in. Its purpose is to 
37268>>>>>    // update properties based on the session and user data. Augment this function to update 
37268>>>>>    // properties based on the session / user table. Note that WebAppUser and WebAppSession contain
37268>>>>>    // the right records when this procedure is called.
37268>>>>>    //
37268>>>>>    // Params:
37268>>>>>    //      bClear   True if the procedure is called before session validation to clear properties.
37268>>>>>    //
37268>>>>>    Procedure UpdateSessionProperties Boolean bClear
37270>>>>>        Handle hoUserDD
37270>>>>>        
37270>>>>>        Get phoUserDD to hoUserDD
37271>>>>>        
37271>>>>>        //  Update user properties
37271>>>>>        If (not(bClear) and HasRecord(hoUserDD)) Begin
37273>>>>>            Set psUsername to (Trim(WebAppUser.FullName))
37274>>>>>            Set psLoginName to (Trim(WebAppUser.LoginName))
37275>>>>>            Set piUserRights to WebAppUser.Rights
37276>>>>>            
37276>>>>>            Send OnSessionPropertiesSet 
37277>>>>>        End
37277>>>>>>
37277>>>>>        Else Begin
37278>>>>>            Set psUsername to ""
37279>>>>>            Set psLoginName to ""
37280>>>>>            Set piUserRights to 0
37281>>>>>            
37281>>>>>            Send OnSessionPropertiesClear
37282>>>>>        End
37282>>>>>>
37282>>>>>    End_Procedure
37283>>>>>    
37283>>>>>    Procedure OnSessionPropertiesSet
37285>>>>>        //  Empty event stub
37285>>>>>    End_Procedure
37286>>>>>    
37286>>>>>    Procedure OnSessionPropertiesClear
37288>>>>>        //  Empty event stub
37288>>>>>    End_Procedure
