37291>>>>>        
37291>>>>>        Get phoSessionDD to hoSessionDD
37292>>>>>        Get pbLogWebSession to bLogWebSession
37293>>>>>        If not bLogWebSession Begin
37295>>>>>            Forward Send EndSession
37297>>>>>            Procedure_Return
37298>>>>>        End
37298>>>>>>
37298>>>>>            
37298>>>>>        //  Check if session exists
37298>>>>>        Send Clear of hoSessionDD
37299>>>>>        Get psSessionKey to WebAppSession.SessionKey
37300>>>>>        
37300>>>>>        Send Find of hoSessionDD EQ Index.1
37301>>>>>        If (Found) Begin
37303>>>>>            Set Field_Changed_Value of hoSessionDD Field WebAppSession.Active to "N"
37304>>>>>            Get Request_Validate of hoSessionDD to iErr
37305>>>>>            If (iErr) Begin
37307>>>>>                // this should not happen. If it does its a programming error
37307>>>>>                Error DFERR_PROGRAM C_$WebAppSessionValidateFailed
37308>>>>>>
37308>>>>>                Procedure_Return
37309>>>>>            End
37309>>>>>>
37309>>>>>            Send Request_Save of hoSessionDD
37310>>>>>        End
